#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:234
msgid "Using SITL with legacy versions of Gazebo"
msgstr "将 SITL 与旧版本的 Gazebo 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:5 b9da4affcb634f8481724cff01bd6bf7
msgid "Using SITL with Gazebo"
msgstr "将 SITL 与 Gazebo 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:7 85c50e85fe7948a696a0916ea174d0c2
msgid ""
"`Gazebo <http://gazebosim.org/>`__ is a well known and respected robotics "
"simulator which has been used in a number of robotics simulation challenges "
"for ground, marine and space based robots, including the DARPA Robotics "
"Challenge, DARPA Subterranean Challenge and Virtual RobotX Competition."
msgstr ""
"`Gazebo <http://gazebosim.org/>`__ "
"是一款知名且受人尊重的机器人仿真器，已被用于多项机器人仿真挑战，涵盖地面、海洋和太空机器人，包括 DARPA 机器人挑战赛、DARPA 地下挑战赛和虚拟"
" RobotX 竞赛。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:12 652efb1024f3482aad47526ad96aaa27
msgid ""
"There are two main generations of Gazebo. To use SITL with Gazebo11 and "
"earlier versions see the :ref:`instructions for legacy versions <sitl-with-"
"gazebo-legacy>`."
msgstr ""
"Gazebo 主要分为两代。要将 SITL 与 Gazebo11 及更早版本配合使用，请参阅 :ref:`旧版本说明 <sitl-with-"
"gazebo-legacy>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:16 4aba5aa5539b4ff8b735a6e96a59845d
msgid ""
"This article explains how to use the latest generation of Gazebo as an "
"external simulator for ArduPilot Rover, Coper and Plane."
msgstr "本文介绍如何将最新一代 Gazebo 用作 ArduPilot Rover、Copter 和 Plane 的外部仿真器。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:23 7bd56b4f18f5401a967145f5d26506e4
msgid ""
"Gazebo is particularly useful for defining autonomous indoor flights, "
"swarms, non-flying vehicle types such as rovers and boats, and multi-vehicle"
" scenarios such as the ship landing simulation in the video above."
msgstr "Gazebo 特别适用于定义自主室内飞行、集群任务、Rover 和船等非飞行飞行器类型，以及上述视频中舰船降落仿真等多飞行器场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:30 13c86de3faac4a6dae654e6f12c0ab95
msgid "Install ArduPilot SITL"
msgstr "安装 ArduPilot SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:32 f8a710b35e1b4d09a26e175129378c31
msgid ""
"Ensure that you have an ArduPilot development environment set up, including "
"MAVProxy as a GCS. Verify that you can run SITL examples for Copter and "
"Plane. The `ArduPilot Development wiki "
"<https://ardupilot.org/dev/index.html>`__ has all the information required."
msgstr ""
"确保已设置 ArduPilot 开发环境，包括作为地面控制站的 MAVProxy。验证可以运行 Copter 和 Plane 的 SITL "
"示例。`ArduPilot 开发 wiki <https://ardupilot.org/dev/index.html>`__ 包含所有所需信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:40 02925044089a4c9bb2501ea45c038a36
msgid "Install Gazebo"
msgstr "安装 Gazebo"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:42 c936f4841dce48f89ccda26f0826b285
msgid ""
"We currently support `Gazebo Garden "
"<https://gazebosim.org/docs/garden/install>`__ and `Gazebo Harmonic "
"<https://gazebosim.org/docs/harmonic/install>`__ which are available for "
"Ubuntu 20.04 (Focal) and 22.04 (Jammy) and macOS Big Sur (11), Monterey "
"(12), and Ventura (13)."
msgstr ""
"目前支持 `Gazebo Garden <https://gazebosim.org/docs/garden/install>`__ 和 `Gazebo"
" Harmonic <https://gazebosim.org/docs/harmonic/install>`__，适用于 Ubuntu "
"20.04（Focal）和 22.04（Jammy）以及 macOS Big Sur（11）、Monterey（12）和 Ventura（13）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:49 906bebfeee404588aaed9870eb89bab8
msgid "Install Gazebo following the instructions for your platform."
msgstr "按照您平台的说明安装 Gazebo。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:51 63b0bd48f0c14450b133e685c31bc69d
msgid "Check that the Gazebo installation is working:"
msgstr "验证 Gazebo 安装是否正常工作："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:57 140326171af54df0ad0249c1727d8b5e
msgid ""
"This should open a world containing a variety of shapes (on macOS you will "
"need to run the Gazebo server and client in separate terminals)."
msgstr "这应该会打开一个包含各种形状的世界（在 macOS 上需要在单独的终端中分别运行 Gazebo 服务器和客户端）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:62 c2d9711c7ed54980bc8535ec6331d02a
msgid "Install the ArduPilot Gazebo Plugin"
msgstr "安装 ArduPilot Gazebo 插件"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:64 28b3496076bd469089b9cd534d2bf10c
msgid ""
"These instructions can also be found in the `ardupilot_gazebo/README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gazebo/blob/main/README.md>`__"
msgstr ""
"这些说明也可以在 `ardupilot_gazebo/README.md "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gazebo/blob/main/README.md>`__ 中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:66 1d1d4c360b464bc8b3e790e872ca55ab
msgid ""
"We use a standard version of ArduPilot with a custom plugin for Gazebo which"
" is hosted on GitHub at: `https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gazebo "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gazebo>`__."
msgstr ""
"我们使用标准版 ArduPilot 和托管在 GitHub 上的 Gazebo "
"自定义插件：`https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gazebo "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot_gazebo>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:71 2d9ebd1917e846489a169ceb883fb496
msgid ""
"While Gazebo is commonly used with ROS / ROS2, the ArduPilot Gazebo plugin "
"does not depend on ROS."
msgstr "虽然 Gazebo 通常与 ROS/ROS2 配合使用，但 ArduPilot Gazebo 插件不依赖于 ROS。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:77 65a8f036a7374aa3a19fa2372c8e6463
msgid ""
"The original version of the plugin located at "
"`https://github.com/khancyr/ardupilot_gazebo "
"<https://github.com/khancyr/ardupilot_gazebo>`__ is compatible with the "
"`legacy versions of Gazebo <https://classic.gazebosim.org/>`__."
msgstr ""
"位于 `https://github.com/khancyr/ardupilot_gazebo "
"<https://github.com/khancyr/ardupilot_gazebo>`__ 的原始版本插件与 `旧版 Gazebo "
"<https://classic.gazebosim.org/>`__ 兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-with-gazebo.rst:82 14cb3f56b4e942cab4195b040c015e39
